<title>HONG KONG: Swank Int'l sells property to chairman.</title>
<headline>Swank Int'l sells property to chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optical products manufacturer Swank International Manufacturing Co Ltd said it has agreed to sell a residential property to chairman Lam Yin Sang for HK$16.50 million.</p>
<p>The property is a house covering a gross floor area of 3,997 square feet on Off Clear Water Bay Road in Hong Kong's New Territories, the company said.</p>
<p>Swank said it would use the proceeds as working capital.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
